==Trivia==
*Lowkey's name may be a play on ''[[wikipedia:Loki|Loki]]'' (the Norse god of trickery) and ''low key'' (relaxed, chill or [[Languid Lakeside|languid]]).
*Lowkey's Japanese name, ''Ko-Gaō'' (古我王), is a pun on the word ''kogao'' (小顔), meaning "small face", which is mentioned in his description. The joke is that it is spelled using the kanji 古, meaning "old", and 王, which means "king" and is found in several other [[The Face|Face]] variants' Japanese names.
*Since [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]] are occasionally associated with trees or forests, Lowkey's peeling white skin may have been inspired by the [[wikipedia:Betula papyrifera|paper birch]], which has white bark that [https://newfs.s3.amazonaws.com/taxon-images-1000s1000/Betulaceae/betula-papyrifera-ba-dcameron-a.jpg peels] in a somewhat similar way. [[Paper Skyscraper]] could further allude to this.
*Lowkey has the lowest movement speed of all Relics and is tied with [[Loris]] for the lowest attack power of all Relics.
*Lowkey had 1,444,444 health before [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

